{"id":"W52edf9b42951237817d7c476","zh":"约束模态","en":"","name":"约束模态","language":"zh","domain":"文献术语","concept_id":null,"families":[],"definition_zh":null,"definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"W52edf9b42951237817d7c476","text":"约束模态","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S9ea233c1ef151f81454c","source_id":"P133","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"CRAIG 等 [16]将HURTY 提出的动态子结构方法进行了改进,将子结构位移分解为约束模态位移与固定对接模态位移的叠加,解决了子结构运动位移问题后,该方法被广泛应用于航空航天、 轮船制造、水利水电以及大型建筑物等复杂系统结构的动力相互作用研究中。","citations":[{"source_id":"P133","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"S63a5052ed6ee4f38ad9f","source_id":"P133","page":3,"page_end":3,"language":"zh","text":"在地震波对建筑物振动影响的研究中,姜忻良等 [20]基于分支模态与约束模态混合法,系统分析了土−结构系统在地震波作用下建筑物的振动响应。","citations":[{"source_id":"P133","page":3,"page_end":3}]}],"sources":{"P133":{"id":"P133","title":"地铁上盖建筑车致环境振动预测模型及影响因素研究","authors":"张小安,王庞瑞,李姝婷,杨建近,徐磊,张晓芸","year":"2025","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.T20250090","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"张小安等（2025）","overview_slug":"2025-study-on-the-prediction-of-building-vibration-induced-by-subway-operation-and-influencing-factors"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"描述界面位移引起子结构变形的模态，用于连接子结构。","language":"zh","source_id":"P133","paper_slug":"2025-study-on-the-prediction-of-building-vibration-induced-by-subway-operation-and-influencing-factors","title":"地铁上盖建筑车致环境振动预测模型及影响因素研究","kind":"paper_usage"}],"word_links":[{"id":"Wea322d12a2232354d2965b48","name":"constraint mode","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"Wea322d12a2232354d2965b48","name":"constraint mode","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"same_language_synonyms":[],"cross_language_equivalents":[{"id":"Wea322d1